sequenceDiagram
    participant Operator as TrustyAI Service Operator
    participant Job as lm-eval Container<br/>(Kubernetes Job)
    participant LLM as LLM Provider API<br/>(OpenAI/Anthropic/watsonx/local)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant HF as Hugging Face Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Output as Local Output Directory<br/>/opt/app-root/src/output

    Note over Operator,Job: Step 1: Job Creation (Kubernetes RBAC)
    Operator->>Job: Create Kubernetes Job<br/>env vars: API keys, model config<br/>args: evaluation parameters

    Note over Job,HF: Step 2: Load Evaluation Tasks & Data
    Job->>HF: GET datasets, models, tokenizers<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN (env var)
    HF-->>Job: Task definitions, datasets

    opt S3 storage configured
        Note over Job,S3: Step 3: Fetch Additional Data (optional)
        Job->>S3: GET model artifacts / datasets<br/>Auth: AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID + AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
        S3-->>Job: Data artifacts
    end

    Note over Job,LLM: Step 4: Run Evaluation Prompts
    loop For each evaluation task
        Job->>LLM: POST inference request<br/>Auth: API key (OPENAI_API_KEY /<br/>ANTHROPIC_API_KEY / WATSONX_API_KEY)
        LLM-->>Job: Model response
        Job->>Job: Score response against<br/>evaluation criteria
    end

    Note over Job,Output: Step 5: Write Results
    Job->>Output: Write structured evaluation results<br/>(JSON/CSV)

    Note over Operator,Output: Job completes, operator collects results
    Job-->>Operator: Job status: Completed
